#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation may liquidate and dissolve within s 211(3)` FALSE (`Vote tally` WITH `votes cast in favour` IS 199, `votes cast against` IS 101, `signed by all the shareholders entitled to vote on the resolution` IS FALSE) FALSE)
